= October 2021

[? if nowa_lewica_merger_agreed and spring_active and spring_in_left and barons_active and barons_in_left: Two decisions compete for our leadership
table: who controls the party we have just merged, and how we answer a
constitutional collision that reaches beyond it.?]
[? if not nowa_lewica_merger_agreed: We have no Nowa Lewica merger to ratify.
Only the constitutional collision reaches our table.?]
[? if nowa_lewica_merger_agreed and (not spring_active or not spring_in_left or not barons_active or not barons_in_left): One or both of the founding currents has left the project, so there is no longer a Nowa Lewica merger to ratify. Only the constitutional collision reaches our table.?]
[? if october_2021_pawlowska_done = 0 and party_unity <= 70: A Wiosna mandate
has also completed its passage from our club to PiS. The current that leads
Lewica must decide whether this is a recruitment failure, a mandate problem or
a gift to Kaczyński.?]

