!}

The text we circulate is short and unheroic: equal treatment in council
services, a named contact for harassment complaints, and a line in the school
budget for anti-bullying work. No ideology, no flag, nothing a treasurer can
call a provocation.

Most councils refuse and a few dozen do not. In those few dozen, something
exists afterwards that was not there before the resolutions, which is the only
form in which this fight produces a permanent gain.

- @october_2021_hub

